  "details": "I want to capture screenshots even in streaming camera mode\n\nI heavily use streaming cameras.\nHowever, when taking a screen shot, you have to switch to the photo camera mode. It is very troublesome.\n\nSometimes it triggers without switching modes. Screenshots are not saved in this case.\n\nAfter taking screenshots, sometimes I forget to switch to streaming camera mode.\nIf you can shoot screenshots with streaming camera, it will be solved all.",
